## Modifications

This version was modified from GScatter 0.12.0 (released by Graswald GmbH, 2025).
The changes are recorded in this project's git history. In summary:

- Renamed the user-facing add-on to "OpenScatter" and changed the extension id.
  Internal identifiers (operator ids, property groups, node names) are kept so
  that scenes made with GScatter continue to work.
- Removed Graswald GmbH branding (logo and tutorial cover art) and third-party
  brand logos (Discord, YouTube, Twitter/X).
- Removed the bundled jsonschema, attrs, pyrsistent and Pillow packages.
- Fixes for Blender 5.x.

